id: pm-vcs-c590
title: Initialize pm-vcs at the source workspace outside Git
description: "A real Bun-installed fresh-project probe showed pm vcs init creates its control directory under .agents/pm when the host cannot resolve repo_root, even though SDK 2026.7.31 supplies source_workspace_root. Root selection must honor the portable workspace coordinate before the legacy pm_root fallback."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: real-e2e,sdk,workspace-root
created_at: "2026-07-31T11:58:00.263Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-31T11:59:32.486Z"
deadline: "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-31T11:59:32.468Z"
completed_at: "2026-07-31T11:59:32.468Z"
claim_principal: "harness:codex"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 20
acceptance_criteria: repo_root wins when present; source_workspace_root is used outside a VCS; pm_root remains the compatibility fallback; automated tests cover all three branches; packed npm and Bun fresh-project installs initialize at the project root
parent: pm-vcs-ijj7
resolution: "Added sourceWorkingRoot with repo, workspace, tracker precedence and routed repository initialization/opening through it."
expected_result: Non-Git projects initialize pm-vcs at the source workspace while preserving repository and legacy tracker fallbacks.
actual_result: Focused tests cover all three coordinates; freshly packed npm and Bun projects both initialized at their project roots and passed deep package doctor.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T11:59:32.117Z","harness:codex","Fresh packed-artifact E2E passed from /tmp with both npm and Bun: pm 2026.7.31 installed and activated all 27 commands, pm vcs init selected the source project root outside Git, and deep isolated package doctor returned zero warnings."
